OL,5,G0325 Clodagh: Cooking at Home
OL,6,     FClodagh McKenna shares her
OL,7,     Fstrategy for throwing a perfect
OL,8,     Ffuss-free dinner party, beginning
OL,9,     Fwith shortcut cacio e pepe cheese
OL,10,     Fstraws to welcome the guests.
OL,11,     FThere is a quick and impressive
OL,12,     FFrench classic chicken fricassee
OL,13,     Ffor the main course, a make-ahead
OL,14,     Fpistachio tiramisu for dessert and
OL,15,     Ffresh mint tea to end the evening.
OL,16,     FHer blueprint includes a stunning
OL,17,     Ftable setting where the trick is
OL,18,     Fkeeping things simple
OL,19,G0350 Unwind with STV
OL,20,     FDaily escape designed to calm the
OL,21,     Fmind and encourage relaxation and
OL,22,     Freflection
